了卡里根。他变成了恶灵骑士，毫不手软的把对手撕成碎片。当战争结束时，三人前往神殿，同时，罗尔科也救醒了死亡边缘的卡里根，并赋予他更可怕的摧毁力，让他再去把丹尼找回来。　　在神殿里，莫罗履行协议把布雷斯体内的扎萨罗斯驱赶了出来。但正当他做法时，神殿的牧师试图杀死丹尼——他认为丹尼就是恶魔。还没等他们行动，卡里根就到了。把丹尼带去见了罗尔科。罗尔科逼迫丹尼参与一个仪式，想使他变成一个彻头彻尾的恶魔。　　布雷斯试图阻止这个仪式，说服丹尼弃恶从善。在最后一战中，为了打败恶魔，丹尼用了他的力量把扎萨罗斯再次植入布雷斯体内。这次扎萨罗斯变成了正义的化身，打败了恶魔。","vod_play_from":"bfzym3u8","vod_play_server":"","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"HD$https:\/\/v.fengbao11.com\/video\/linghunzhanche2fuchoushike\/HD\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"","vod_down_server":"","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"动作片"},{"vod_id":154399,"type_id":21,"type_id_1":20,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"失范之城","vod_sub":"Anomie-The Equation of Death \/ അനോമി","vod_en":"shifanzhicheng","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"S","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"动作","vod_pic":"https:\/\/img.picbf.com\/upload\/vod\/20260725-1\/5cc513ebf81fd1fd36d4412ff4533116.webp","vod_pic_thumb":"","vod_pic_slide":"","vod_pic_screenshot":"","vod_actor":"Shebin Benson , Drishya Raghunath , Bhavana , Rahman , Binu Pappu , Vishnu Agasthya , Arjun Lal , Jinse Baskar","vod_director":"Riyas Marath","vod_writer":"","vod_behind":"","vod_blurb":"扎拉（Zaara）的弟弟失踪了。在警方多日调查无果后，这位坚韧的姐姐开始当面质问办案警官。随着对系统信心的崩塌，她决定无视一切规则，踏上独自寻找弟弟的平行征途。这条执着的追寻之路，最终将引向一个令人毛骨悚然的真相。","vod_remarks":"更新至HD","vod_pubdate":"","vod_total":0,"vod_serial":"0","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"印度","vod_lang":"","vod_year":"2026","vod_version":"","vod_state":"","vod_author":"","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":649,"vod_hits_day":63,"vod_hits_week":251,"vod_hits_month":423,"vod_duration":"","vod_up":294,"vod_down":470,"vod_score":"5.0","vod_score_all":4260,"vod_score_num":852,"vod_time":"2026-07-25 13:19:32","vod_time_add":1784956766,"vod_time_hits":0,"vod_time_make":0,"vod_trysee":0,"vod_douban_id":38246389,"vod_douban_scor